      },
      "text": "Section 1. E s ta b lis h m e n t o f  B o a rd . There is hereby established, effective \nAugust 30,1985, a board of three members to be appointed by the President to \ninvestigate this dispute. No member shall be pecuniarily or otherwise interest­\ned in any organization of railroad employees or any carrier. The board shall \nperform its functions subject to the availability of funds."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2134,
      "char_start": 1988,
